"NSLocationUsageDescription" = "Used to show the current Wi-Fi network name in the popover and, when you open Wi-Fi details, to read network names, scan results, and connection information. If you turn on Weather, an approximate location (about 1 km) is also used for the forecast.";
"NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription" = "Used to show the current Wi-Fi network name in the popover and, when you open Wi-Fi details, to read network names, scan results, and connection information. If you turn on Weather, an approximate location (about 1 km) is also used for the forecast.";
"NSBluetoothAlwaysUsageDescription" = "Shows Bluetooth connection status, reads battery/model metadata for nearby named devices and devices already trusted by this Mac, and switches noise-control mode on supported headphones; nearby devices are read only when explicitly authorized by BLE UUID.";
